   "source": [
    "# MedAI Supply Chain Security Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "**Organization:** MedAI Solutions  \n",
    "**Context:** Healthcare AI Supply Chain Security Audit (HIPAA)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook reconstructs the MedAI audit scenario:\n",
    "- Typosquatted malicious package (`tensorflov`) causing PHI exfiltration\n",
    "- Vulnerability inventory and risk assessment\n",
    "- License compliance analysis\n",
    "- SBOM (CycloneDX) excerpt\n",
    "- Dependency monitoring policy (Deliverable 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "All artifacts are written as files so they can be used as lab deliverables or checked into GitHub."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Executive Summary & Malicious Package Investigation\n",
    "\n",
    "We model the incident described in the report:\n",
    "- Malicious PyPI package: **`tensorflov`** (typosquat of `tensorflow`)\n",
    "- Installed via `requirements.txt`\n",
    "- `setup.py` establishes a reverse shell and exfiltrates:\n",
    "  - 50,000+ chest X-rays\n",
    "  - Proprietary model weights\n",
    "- Result: Severe HIPAA violation and supply chain compromise.\n",
    "\n",
    "Below we encode this as structured evidence for the audit."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    \"\"\"Malicious package investigation evidence\"\"\"\n",
    "malicious_package_evidence = {\n",
    "    \"package_name\": \"tensorflov\",\n",
    "    \"mimics\": \"tensorflow\",\n",
    "    \"type\": \"typosquat\",\n",
    "    \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\",\n",
    "    \"cvss\": 10.0,\n",
    "    \"behavior\": {\n",
    "        \"entry_point\": \"setup.py\",\n",
    "        \"actions\": [\n",
    "            \"establishes reverse shell\",\n",
    "            \"exfiltrates chest X-ray images\",\n",
    "            \"exfiltrates model weights\"\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        \"exfiltrated_records\": 50000,\n",
    "        \"regulatory_impact\": \"HIPAA violation\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "malicious_package_evidence"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
