   "source": [
    "## 3. Vulnerability Inventory & Risk Matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "We encode the table from the report as structured data:\n",
    "- Includes `tensorflov` (no CVE, but CRITICAL)\n",
    "- GitPython, urllib3, py with their CVEs and severities\n",
    "- Risk score is conceptual (CVSS × Exploitability × Data Sensitivity)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "vulnerabilities = [\n",
