   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. SBOM (CycloneDX 1.4) – Deliverable 2\n",
    "\n",
    "We now reconstruct the SBOM excerpt from the report as a real `sbom.json` file:\n",
    "- Format: CycloneDX 1.4\n",
    "- Application: `MedAI-Diagnostic-Platform` v2.1.0\n",
    "- Components: `tensorflow`, `scikit-learn` (and we add a couple of realistic extras)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import json\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "sbom = {\n",
    "    \"bomFormat\": \"CycloneDX\",\n",
    "    \"specVersion\": \"1.4\",\n",
    "    \"version\": 1,\n",
    "    \"metadata\": {\n",
    "        \"timestamp\": \"2023-10-25T14:32:00Z\",\n",
    "        \"component\": {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"application\",\n",
    "            \"name\": \"MedAI-Diagnostic-Platform\",\n",
    "            \"version\": \"2.1.0\"\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"components\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"library\",\n",
    "            \"name\": \"tensorflow\",\n",
    "            \"version\": \"2.13.0\",\n",
    "            \"licenses\": [{\"license\": {\"id\": \"Apache-2.0\"}}],\n",
